learn-title = Learn
learn-intro = Short lessons you can follow in the workspace. Each one opens the tool or panel it teaches.
learn-welcome-title = Welcome to Flare
learn-welcome-body = New here? The lessons below show you how to draw, animate and publish. You can come back any time from Help > Learn.
learn-take-tour = Take the tour
learn-skip = Skip
learn-try = Try it
menu-item-learn = Learn

learn-draw-title = Draw
learn-draw-summary = Make your first drawing with the pencil and the brush.
learn-draw-step-1 = Pick the Pencil tool and draw on the stage.
learn-draw-step-2 = Hold to smooth a stroke; the brush follows pressure.
learn-draw-step-3 = Choose a color and a width in the tools panel.

learn-frames-title = Frames and the timeline
learn-frames-summary = Create frames and play back your animation.
learn-frames-step-1 = Select a frame in the timeline.
learn-frames-step-2 = Press F6 to insert a keyframe.
learn-frames-step-3 = Press the space bar to start and stop playback.

learn-symbols-title = Symbols
learn-symbols-summary = Reuse drawings as symbols so the library stays tidy.
learn-symbols-step-1 = Select the drawing you want to reuse.
learn-symbols-step-2 = Press F8 to turn it into a symbol.
learn-symbols-step-3 = Drag the symbol from the library onto the stage.

learn-animate-title = Animate
learn-animate-summary = Move objects across the stage with motion tweens.
learn-animate-step-1 = Select an object on the stage.
learn-animate-step-2 = Right-click a frame and choose Create Motion Tween.
learn-animate-step-3 = Move the playhead and drag the object to its new place.

learn-rig-title = Rig
learn-rig-summary = Connect limbs with bones and pose them.
learn-rig-step-1 = Open Window > Rigs.
learn-rig-step-2 = Draw bones over the limbs of your character.
learn-rig-step-3 = Set key poses on the timeline.

learn-effects-title = Effects
learn-effects-summary = Add filters and effects without changing the drawing.
learn-effects-step-1 = Open Window > Effects.
learn-effects-step-2 = Add a filter to a layer or an object.
learn-effects-step-3 = Adjust the settings and watch the result on the stage.

learn-publish-title = Publish
learn-publish-summary = Export your work as video, an image sequence or a sprite sheet.
learn-publish-step-1 = Open File > Publish.
learn-publish-step-2 = Choose a format and a location.
learn-publish-step-3 = Click Publish and open the file.
